{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n \n こんばんは⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᗜ'๑⃙⃘)⸝\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ20WM7X4JCCNCP7WGH3D3Z2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n この前バレンタインにみんなでチョコレート交換をしました(*^^*)♪\n \n \n 手作りだったりチョコだったり、チョコセットを包んでくれたり😌\n \n \n \n もーね、高校生に戻った気分でしたσ(´∀ ｀●)\n \n \n \n \n \n みーぱんはね、今回は安定のクッキーとパウンドケーキを作りました🥰\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ20X9VEEP4GQ1XMGKF5PWCK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n この量から\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ20XAVDSHY75FY15GTG5XWC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n ここまで増やしました（笑）\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ20XBTJV228W51M016ZTVGV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n これはおひなが作ってくれたバームクーヘン。\n すごいよね！！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ20XCSGG9KPJKH1PEGAWJYG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ20XDRWRWZG54JD5PFVTV25","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n これはくみのパウンドケーキ😌\n \n \n \n \n 他にも沢山もらって全部が美味しかったよーー‪⸜(*ˊᵕˋ*)⸝‬\n \n 幸せな一日でした。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"}